WEBVTT

00:04.340 --> 00:07.020
This is the king's castle?

00:07.020 --> 00:10.110
You've never been here before, right?

00:10.110 --> 00:12.580
That's why I wanted to take you here.

00:14.990 --> 00:18.260
<i>What if I meet the king 
and offend him somehow?</i>

00:18.260 --> 00:23.230
<i>Yuna Sis, Mom, Shuri, and Dad...</i>

00:24.040 --> 00:27.100
<i>Forgive me if I get the death penalty!</i>

02:03.600 --> 02:05.810
Are these the golems 
the witches were talking about?!

02:12.520 --> 02:13.770
<i>It didn't hurt?</i>

02:14.260 --> 02:18.740
An attack like that could 
never hurt a hero like me!

02:24.750 --> 02:26.940
<i>I can't breathe.</i>

02:26.940 --> 02:28.620
<i>Is this some kind of magic?</i>

02:29.420 --> 02:32.960
<i>I can't believe something 
like this is what kills me...</i>

02:35.630 --> 02:40.550
<b>Bear, Becoming the Hero(?)</b>

02:35.630 --> 02:40.550
<b>Bear, Becoming the Hero(?)</b>

02:36.290 --> 02:37.990
I can't breathe!

02:41.690 --> 02:46.110
Did you guys just cause that nightmare?

02:46.510 --> 02:48.560
Why'd you do that?

02:52.590 --> 02:54.980
Oh, it's already morning...

02:54.980 --> 02:57.590
Thanks for waking me up.

02:57.590 --> 03:01.110
Next time, don't do it by 
making it hard for me to breathe.

03:03.970 --> 03:07.290
Welp, time to exterminate some golems.

03:09.490 --> 03:11.290
Morning, Yuna!

03:11.290 --> 03:12.510
Morning.

03:12.940 --> 03:15.480
Are you going to the mine 
after breakfast, Yuna?

03:15.480 --> 03:17.420
Yup, that's the plan.

03:17.830 --> 03:22.380
<i>I have to finish the job fast 
and rescue my captured princess.</i>

03:22.380 --> 03:24.860
How about going together?

03:24.860 --> 03:26.440
With your party?

03:26.440 --> 03:29.730
I know you're strong, but the way you look...

03:29.730 --> 03:32.250
I can only see you as a cute bear.

03:32.250 --> 03:34.830
I'm worried that bad people will 
bother you because of how you look.

03:34.830 --> 03:36.240
I can't leave you alone.

03:36.240 --> 03:38.820
That's why I talked to Mel 
about it last night.

03:38.820 --> 03:43.940
<i>It's easier to move around alone.
 What should I do?</i>

03:44.310 --> 03:46.780
<i>First of all, she should stop petting my head.</i>

03:46.780 --> 03:48.360
You guys are up early.

03:48.360 --> 03:50.810
The two of you are just late.

03:50.810 --> 03:53.710
By the way, Yuna is coming with us.

03:53.710 --> 03:55.440
Got it.

03:55.440 --> 03:56.670
I don't mind.

03:56.670 --> 03:58.270
It's decided, then!

03:58.270 --> 03:59.510
Yeah!

03:59.800 --> 04:03.720
<i>Wait. I didn't say I'd go...</i>

04:10.310 --> 04:14.860
Looks like Barbould's party went in 
using a different entrance.

04:14.860 --> 04:17.900
Perfect. Less trouble for us.

04:18.280 --> 04:19.360
<i>Barbould?</i>

04:24.510 --> 04:26.820
Oh, the Bozo Rangers.

04:29.450 --> 04:31.560
There it is. A mad golem.

04:37.670 --> 04:41.940
You can defeat a golem by removing 
or destroying the mana gem inside of it.

04:41.940 --> 04:47.260
But since the mana gem is valuable, 
it's better not to destroy it.

04:47.260 --> 04:50.630
I see. Can you defeat it any other way?

04:50.630 --> 04:53.950
If you damage them beyond a certain point,

04:53.950 --> 04:58.000
the magic in the mana gem will drop 
enough that they'll stop moving.

05:02.610 --> 05:05.790
Fina, where do you want to go?

05:05.790 --> 05:08.820
Um, I don't know.

05:09.280 --> 05:12.240
You don't have to be so nervous.

05:12.670 --> 05:18.430
I'll take care of anyone 
who bullies you in Yuna's place.

05:18.430 --> 05:21.500
Even if it's the king himself.

05:22.770 --> 05:24.380
<i>The king!</i>

05:27.810 --> 05:28.970
My stomach...

05:30.000 --> 05:32.310
Then, I know the perfect place!

05:33.410 --> 05:37.310
<i>Yuna Sis, save me...</i>

05:40.010 --> 05:41.480
Rock golems!

05:45.900 --> 05:47.940
Yuna! Can you handle one of them?!

05:47.940 --> 05:49.280
Got it.

05:49.280 --> 05:51.260
Bear Punch!

05:55.000 --> 05:56.720
A single punch?!

05:57.500 --> 05:59.010
Punch!

06:02.030 --> 06:03.590
<i>They're not a big deal.</i>

06:03.590 --> 06:06.140
Yuna, you're so strong!

06:06.140 --> 06:07.540
Just like the rumors.

06:07.540 --> 06:11.640
But looks like we shouldn't 
leave everything to Yuna.

06:11.640 --> 06:15.640
We'll be buried alive before 
all the golems are defeated.

06:15.640 --> 06:17.100
<i>True.</i>

06:17.910 --> 06:19.520
If I go all-out...

06:22.490 --> 06:27.040
<i>We'll suffocate if I use fire 
magic in an enclosed space...</i>

06:29.450 --> 06:31.030
I can't breathe...

06:31.610 --> 06:33.370
<i>It's hard to fight here.</i>

06:35.250 --> 06:36.730
So pretty...

06:36.730 --> 06:38.960
The castle is very proud of this garden.

06:43.630 --> 06:45.420
Isn't it beautiful?

06:45.420 --> 06:50.050
Ellalaura, what are you doing 
in a place like this?

06:50.050 --> 06:52.710
The king and his princess!

06:52.710 --> 06:57.390
I'm off today, so I decided to 
show this child around the castle.

06:58.180 --> 06:59.170
Hm?

06:59.170 --> 07:02.040
Oh, the young girl that was in Yuna's house.

07:02.040 --> 07:04.030
Your name is Fina, right?

07:04.030 --> 07:06.110
Miss Bear's friend!

07:06.110 --> 07:07.620
Y-Yes!

07:07.620 --> 07:12.900
Lady Ellalaura has been kind enough 
to show me around the castle today!

07:12.900 --> 07:14.580
Thank you very much!

07:15.850 --> 07:18.590
No need to be so stiff.

07:18.590 --> 07:21.170
Unlike Yuna, you are quite well-mannered.

07:21.640 --> 07:25.760
Oh, my. I feel bad for Yuna 
when you word it like that.

07:25.760 --> 07:30.220
She has never once taken the effort to 
come and say hello to me when she visits.

07:30.220 --> 07:34.300
Well, Yuna is usually here 
just to see Princess Flora.

07:34.680 --> 07:38.810
Yes, there's no helping 
how cute my daughter is.

07:38.810 --> 07:43.790
But the last time that I visited Flora's room 
because I heard Yuna was visiting...

07:43.790 --> 07:45.580
You're here, Yuna.

07:45.580 --> 07:49.360
Father, I'm reading picture 
books with Miss Bear right now.

07:54.580 --> 07:57.030
She looked so annoyed.

07:57.030 --> 08:01.270
I'm quite sure she doesn't 
think of me as a king at all.

08:01.270 --> 08:05.130
<i>Yuna Sis, what are you doing 
in front of the king?!</i>

08:05.580 --> 08:08.670
But you don't dislike Yuna, do you?

08:08.670 --> 08:10.270
True.

08:10.270 --> 08:15.010
She's kind to my daughter and 
protected the royal capital from danger.

08:15.010 --> 08:17.830
I'm friends with Miss Bear!

08:17.830 --> 08:19.470
And her pudding is yummy!

08:19.930 --> 08:23.350
<i>She has the king and princess 
wrapped around her little finger?!</i>

08:28.830 --> 08:32.320
The iron golems are a lot harder to cut down.

08:37.570 --> 08:40.970
Wow! They managed to 
cut through iron golems!

08:40.970 --> 08:44.910
Senia's knife and Jaden's 
sword are made of mithril.

08:44.910 --> 08:45.920
Mithril?!

08:45.920 --> 08:47.520
That's right.

08:47.520 --> 08:50.900
Jeez, I wish I had a mithril sword.

08:50.900 --> 08:53.510
An iron golem would be super easy to cut down!

08:53.510 --> 08:59.800
Oh, having a mithril weapon doesn't 
mean you can cut down an iron golem.

08:59.800 --> 09:02.640
Jaden and Senia can do it because 
they have the skills to back it up.

09:02.640 --> 09:04.600
It'd be impossible for Toya.

09:05.060 --> 09:07.550
<i>I want mithril so bad!</i>

09:11.380 --> 09:13.530
Is someone fighting over there?

09:21.990 --> 09:23.700
It's so hard!

09:28.130 --> 09:29.840
Magic doesn't work on it, either.

09:29.840 --> 09:31.620
What should we do?

09:32.180 --> 09:34.480
As expected, it's Barbould's party.

09:34.480 --> 09:36.940
More importantly, what kind of golem is that?

09:36.940 --> 09:39.260
It's the wrong color for an iron golem.

09:39.870 --> 09:43.600
<i>It's not that the Bozo Rangers are weak.</i>

09:43.990 --> 09:46.310
<i>That golem's body is just too hard.</i>

09:46.310 --> 09:48.600
The golem's body...

09:48.600 --> 09:50.900
Is it a mithril golem?!

09:50.900 --> 09:52.640
A mithril golem?!

09:52.640 --> 09:53.690
Huh?!

09:53.230 --> 09:54.940
<b>Mithril Golem</b>

09:54.870 --> 09:56.070
<i>He's right.</i>

09:56.070 --> 09:59.570
If that's the case, 
Barbould's party is in trouble.

09:59.570 --> 10:01.030
The enemy is too strong.

10:03.330 --> 10:04.370
Jaden...

10:04.370 --> 10:07.460
A mithril golem? Need help?

10:07.790 --> 10:09.610
This is ours!

10:09.610 --> 10:13.550
We don't need your help! Don't you dare!

10:13.550 --> 10:15.180
What should we do, Jaden?

10:15.180 --> 10:18.280
He told us not to help.

10:18.280 --> 10:22.090
And I'm not sure if we could take it down 
even if we all worked together.

10:22.090 --> 10:26.220
Right. Magic wouldn't work on a mithril golem.

10:26.600 --> 10:28.440
And most physical attacks 
won't work, either.

10:28.860 --> 10:32.150
I could cut it down if I had a mithril sword!

10:40.120 --> 10:43.380
We're heading home, then.

10:43.380 --> 10:49.290
Don't worry, we'll still report your 
heroic battle to the guild if you die!

10:49.290 --> 10:50.730
We won't die!

10:50.730 --> 10:53.250
Take your pet with you and scram!

10:54.100 --> 10:56.340
By pet, is he talking about me?

10:59.880 --> 11:01.870
<i>A mithril golem...</i>

11:01.870 --> 11:06.810
<i>That means I'll be able to get 
some mithril if I take one out!</i>

11:09.430 --> 11:13.690
What should we do about the job now, Jaden?

11:13.690 --> 11:19.990
If Barbould can't take it down with his 
mithril sword, we'll have to give up.

11:19.990 --> 11:21.190
Right...

11:21.190 --> 11:26.450
They look stupid, but they 
have good equipment and skills.

11:27.330 --> 11:30.300
Shit! It's impossible to 
take one of those down!

11:30.300 --> 11:31.740
Seriously!

11:31.740 --> 11:34.170
I can't believe none of our attacks worked...

11:34.170 --> 11:36.000
Oh, you made it back alive?

11:36.000 --> 11:39.460
Like I'd die! But it was still impossible.

11:39.460 --> 11:41.000
That's what I thought.

11:41.000 --> 11:43.430
Looks like we'll have to 
report it to the guild.

11:43.800 --> 11:47.340
Maybe soldiers or magic casters that
are knight class from the royal capital

11:47.340 --> 11:48.310
can do something about it?

11:48.310 --> 11:51.520
They have the people 
and the equipment for it.

11:51.520 --> 11:55.260
So it goes. Looks like 
we've done all we can here.

11:55.640 --> 11:59.110
A round of drinks 
for Barbould's party, on me.

11:59.600 --> 12:01.080
Just one round?

12:01.080 --> 12:03.130
I'll treat you to as many rounds as you want

12:03.130 --> 12:05.070
if you could tell us how 
to defeat that thing.

12:05.860 --> 12:07.400
Thanks for waiting!

12:07.400 --> 12:11.230
Whatever. I'll just rake in as much 
as I can from the iron golems

12:11.230 --> 12:13.390
until the soldiers from the capital arrive.

12:13.390 --> 12:15.020
Yeah, sounds good.

12:16.130 --> 12:18.920
No point is taking unnecessary risks.

12:21.480 --> 12:22.550
Where are you going?

12:23.170 --> 12:25.210
I'm heading to bed.

12:27.650 --> 12:30.280
Sounds like they've all given up.

12:30.280 --> 12:32.670
But not me.

12:33.140 --> 12:36.550
I'll take down the mithril golem 
before the soldiers get here

12:36.550 --> 12:38.950
and get my hands on some mithril!

12:50.820 --> 12:53.260
This area looks pretty quiet.

12:53.260 --> 12:56.490
Welp, time for some experimenting!

13:07.570 --> 13:10.360
Demon King, we have brought you the princess.

13:10.360 --> 13:12.170
Excellent work.

13:12.590 --> 13:14.980
What are you planning to do with me?!

13:16.490 --> 13:18.440
What a feisty princess!

13:18.890 --> 13:22.400
The hero will definitely come to save me!

13:22.720 --> 13:23.900
Oh?

13:23.900 --> 13:25.690
Take a look at this.

13:26.860 --> 13:30.250
This is the current state of your hero.

13:32.650 --> 13:36.120
I'll be able to get mithril 
if I take down a mithril golem!

13:36.460 --> 13:37.760
Mithril!

13:38.080 --> 13:39.800
Mithril!

13:40.040 --> 13:42.500
Mithril!

13:42.830 --> 13:45.470
Who cares about anything else?!

13:47.070 --> 13:52.850
The hero is so obsessed with mithril 
that she has already forgotten about you!

13:52.850 --> 13:54.850
What?!

13:54.850 --> 13:57.810
The Bear Hero is so strong!

14:05.830 --> 14:07.290
A dream...

14:07.290 --> 14:10.090
Morning, Kumayuru, Kumakyu.

14:11.100 --> 14:13.540
<i>How is Fina doing?</i>

14:13.540 --> 14:17.760
<i>I'm sure she's fine since 
Ms. Ellalaura is with her.</i>

14:19.930 --> 14:24.790
Okay, I need to take down that 
mithril golem and head back.

14:27.550 --> 14:29.260
Bear Cutter!

14:34.800 --> 14:37.390
Next are iron golems.

14:39.690 --> 14:43.280
Kumayuru. Kumakyu. I'm fine, so don't move.

14:44.820 --> 14:50.940
<i>I have to restrain myself in the tunnel, 
so I don't make it collapse.</i>

14:50.940 --> 14:55.540
<i>So I should find the enemy's 
weakness as efficiently as possible.</i>

14:56.000 --> 14:59.310
Well, let's see if this'll work out.

15:00.990 --> 15:03.700
Electric Bear Punch, Weak!

15:09.190 --> 15:16.010
In manga and games, the weakness 
of metal monsters is always the same.

15:17.430 --> 15:19.240
<i>Think of the image...</i>

15:19.990 --> 15:23.000
<i>An image of mana being 
changed into electricity...</i>

15:26.900 --> 15:31.730
<i>Imagine the electricity going through the 
body and attacking the mana gem directly.</i>

15:42.290 --> 15:44.320
Great! I did it.

15:46.150 --> 15:49.770
Looks like I'll be able to 
finish the job today.

15:49.770 --> 15:52.420
I'll be able to get back to Fina soon.

15:59.940 --> 16:02.130
A huge feast?!

16:02.980 --> 16:05.750
It's nice to have tea 
in the garden sometimes.

16:06.290 --> 16:09.190
I had various things prepared. 
Eat whatever you like.

16:09.190 --> 16:11.420
R-Right...

16:11.420 --> 16:14.740
Then I'll pour you some juice.

16:18.290 --> 16:19.150
Here.

16:19.550 --> 16:21.910
Thank you very much?

16:23.290 --> 16:24.750
Are you all right, Fina?!

16:25.360 --> 16:27.710
Sorry, Fina! Are you all right?

16:27.710 --> 16:29.670
I-I'm so sorry!

16:30.200 --> 16:33.490
<i>The clothes! The food! The cup!</i>

16:33.490 --> 16:34.880
<i>Compensation!</i>

16:36.300 --> 16:40.020
Fina, don't touch the broken cup.
 The shards are dangerous.

16:40.020 --> 16:42.350
Um, about the compensation...

16:42.350 --> 16:44.690
Huh? What are you talking about?

16:50.760 --> 16:53.070
You were thinking about things like that?

16:53.070 --> 16:55.940
There's no need for any compensation.

16:55.940 --> 17:01.160
Noir often gets her clothes 
dirty and spills her food, too.

17:01.160 --> 17:03.870
That's right. You can do it, Fina!

17:04.290 --> 17:06.600
Shia did the same thing 
when she was young, too.

17:07.350 --> 17:08.220
Yes.

17:08.220 --> 17:13.640
Even if you rip your clothes or get 
them dirty, I'll make them good as new.

17:13.640 --> 17:17.050
Also, I've brought you a change of clothes.

17:17.050 --> 17:19.480
This is pretty, too.

17:21.940 --> 17:23.770
My stomach...

17:23.770 --> 17:25.770
Electric Bear Punch!

17:31.450 --> 17:34.070
That takes care of all the iron golems.

17:35.530 --> 17:36.400
<b>Mithril Golem</b>

17:36.400 --> 17:39.360
Looks like it's time.

17:47.040 --> 17:49.180
Electric Bear Punch!

17:52.210 --> 17:54.730
<i>My new magic skill doesn't work.</i>

17:54.730 --> 17:55.920
<i>If that's the case...</i>

17:57.350 --> 17:58.840
Bear Cutter!

18:08.160 --> 18:10.190
<i>Its defense is too high.</i>

18:10.580 --> 18:13.440
<i>It can't be helped. Time to use my trump card.</i>

18:24.410 --> 18:27.250
Now I can go all-out.

18:27.620 --> 18:29.290
Bear Fire Magic!

18:34.000 --> 18:39.600
Bear Uppercut!

18:40.930 --> 18:46.890
Even a mithril golem shouldn't be 
able to take a fall from that height.

19:04.270 --> 19:06.120
It can still move?

19:07.000 --> 19:10.790
Then, I'll attack the gem directly!

19:11.200 --> 19:13.460
Electric Bear Punch!

19:20.120 --> 19:21.370
It's over.

19:23.050 --> 19:24.300
Thanks for waiting!

19:24.300 --> 19:27.890
Let's clean up the rest 
of the golems on our way back.

19:30.150 --> 19:31.100
What's wrong?

19:33.420 --> 19:34.960
What is this?

19:38.530 --> 19:42.660
<b>Bearmonite</b>

19:38.910 --> 19:41.040
Bearmonite?

19:41.780 --> 19:42.670
A message?

19:42.660 --> 19:58.000
<b>Sender: God</b>

19:42.670 --> 19:46.600
It's from the god that sent me to this world.

19:46.600 --> 19:48.100
<i>Dear Yuna,</i>

19:48.100 --> 19:50.310
<i>Are you working hard at adventuring?</i>

19:50.310 --> 19:53.210
<i>I prepared a present for you today.</i>

19:53.210 --> 19:54.560
<i>I forgot to tell you that I'll prepare</i>

19:54.560 --> 19:58.000
<i>all sorts of presents for you every 
once in a while, so try to find them.</i>

19:58.000 --> 20:01.970
Is this why the golems 
kept spawning infinitely?

20:02.370 --> 20:07.330
If this happened because 
of an item that God sent me...

20:07.820 --> 20:10.670
In a way, isn't this actually my fault?

20:12.080 --> 20:14.650
I'm so tired.

20:15.000 --> 20:19.270
<i>It took a while to take care 
of the rest of the golems.</i>

20:19.650 --> 20:25.620
<i>It can't be helped, since the job 
was to take care of all of them...</i>

20:27.240 --> 20:29.850
Yuna, where'd you go off to?

20:29.850 --> 20:33.330
We were worried since we noticed 
you weren't in your room.

20:33.330 --> 20:38.460
I went to the cave by myself. 
You guys didn't go?

20:38.890 --> 20:42.340
Yeah, we drank too much with 
Barbould's party last night.

20:42.340 --> 20:44.510
I woke up in the afternoon.

20:44.510 --> 20:45.870
Me, too.

20:45.870 --> 20:48.100
Oh, I see.

20:48.100 --> 20:51.800
Oh, Mr. Jaden, can you do me a favor?

20:51.800 --> 20:52.980
What is it?

20:52.980 --> 20:56.860
I've defeated all the golems, 
including the mithril one.

20:56.860 --> 20:59.070
Can you confirm things tomorrow?

21:00.910 --> 21:03.910
Sorry, what did you just say?

21:03.910 --> 21:06.130
I've defeated all the golems, including...

21:06.130 --> 21:08.160
You're joking, right?!

21:10.030 --> 21:12.770
I really did.

21:12.770 --> 21:16.500
I don't know if they'll spawn again though...

21:16.500 --> 21:19.210
Hey! Pet! Don't lie!

21:19.210 --> 21:22.670
The five of us couldn't take that golem down!

21:23.770 --> 21:27.220
You're saying that a pet like you 
took it down alone?!

21:27.220 --> 21:28.850
Don't make me laugh!

21:28.850 --> 21:30.130
Pet?

21:36.890 --> 21:39.080
Barbould?! What's wrong?!

21:41.480 --> 21:44.240
He's probably still drunk.

21:44.240 --> 21:47.300
I can't imagine Barbould getting 
drunk from drinking so little...

21:47.300 --> 21:48.740
But he passed out.

21:49.950 --> 21:52.140
<i>I might've overdone it a bit.</i>

21:52.140 --> 21:57.500
<i>Well, it's his fault for 
calling me a pet all the time.</i>

21:58.060 --> 22:00.520
<i>I'll go back to Fina tomorrow!</i>

22:01.440 --> 22:03.420
<i>I wonder how Fina is doing.</i>

23:35.430 --> 23:40.080
<b>Bear, Getting Lectured</b>

23:35.470 --> 23:40.080
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:35.870 --> 23:37.480
Bear...
